<mxCell id="legend" value="Hover over a box for full detail. Solid = proposed · grey dashed = future systems. Every route's Lambda uses the shared module. Flows: Email_Consent_Update, Website_Consent_Update. Parts: &lt;font face=&quot;Menlo&quot;&gt;send_to_cpms/building_blocks.md&lt;/font&gt; → CPMS_Router." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="770" width="1560" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
